  "title": "Absolutely The Best Shrimp Scampi",
  "description": "Shrimp sauteed in olive oil, with a brandy sauce flavored with garlic shallots and oregano. Great served with a rice pilaf and salad!",
  "authors": [
    "Kat"
  ],
